# POVZETEK IZBOLJŠAV - DELEGATI IN EVENTI

## Kaj je bilo dodano?

### 1. PlayerStats.cs - Dodani Event
**Prej:**
```csharp
public class PlayerStats
{
    public readonly DateTime StartedAt;
    public int PlayedItemsCount { get; private set; }

    public PlayerStats()
    {
        StartedAt = DateTime.Now;
        PlayedItemsCount = 0;
    }

    public void Increment()
    {
        PlayedItemsCount++;
    }
}
```

**Sedaj:**
```csharp
public class PlayerStats
{
    // NOVO: Delegate
    public delegate void ItemPlayedEventHandler(string itemTitle, int totalPlayed);

    // NOVO: Event
    public event ItemPlayedEventHandler ItemPlayed;

    public readonly DateTime StartedAt;
    public int PlayedItemsCount { get; private set; }

    public PlayerStats()
    {
        StartedAt = DateTime.Now;
        PlayedItemsCount = 0;
    }

    public void Increment()
    {
        PlayedItemsCount++;
        OnItemPlayed("Pesem predvajana", PlayedItemsCount);  // NOVO: Sproži event
    }

    // NOVO: Metoda, ki sproži event
    protected virtual void OnItemPlayed(string title, int count)
    {
        ItemPlayed?.Invoke(title, count);
    }
}
```

**Kaj je novo?**
- ✅ Delegate `ItemPlayedEventHandler`
- ✅ Event `ItemPlayed`
- ✅ Metoda `OnItemPlayed()` za sproženje eventa
- ✅ Komentar, ki pojasnjuje kaj se dogaja

