### 3. Form1.cs - Naročanja na Eventi

**Prej:**
```csharp
public Form1()
{
    InitializeComponent();

    playlist = new Playlist();
    stats = new PlayerStats();
    
    // Samo osnovne nastavitve
    trkVolume.Minimum = 0;
    trkVolume.Maximum = 100;
    // ...
}
```

**Sedaj:**
```csharp
public Form1()
{
    InitializeComponent();

    playlist = new Playlist();
    stats = new PlayerStats();

    // NOVO: Naročanja na Custom Eventi
    stats.ItemPlayed += stats_ItemPlayed;
    playlist.PlaylistChanged += playlist_PlaylistChanged;
    playlist.PlaylistError += playlist_PlaylistError;

    // NOVO: Naročanja na Windows Media Player Eventi
    axWindowsMediaPlayer.PlayStateChange += axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange;
    axWindowsMediaPlayer.OpenStateChange += axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange;

    // Osnovne nastavitve
    trkVolume.Minimum = 0;
    trkVolume.Maximum = 100;
    // ...
}

// NOVO: Event Handleri za Custom Eventi
private void stats_ItemPlayed(string itemTitle, int totalPlayed)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Dogodek: {itemTitle} | Skupno predvajanih: {totalPlayed}");
}

private void playlist_PlaylistChanged(string sprememba, int novaKolicina)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Sprememba playliste: {sprememba} | Skupno pesmi: {novaKolicina}");
}

private void playlist_PlaylistError(object sender, PlaylistErrorEventArgs e)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Napaka: {e.Sporocilo} (Tip: {e.Tip})");
}

// NOVO: Event Handler za Windows Media Player
private void axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange(object sender, _WMPOCXEvents_OpenStateChangeEvent e)
{
    if (e.newState == 13)
    {
        Console.WriteLine("Datoteka je uspešno odprta");
    }
}

// NOVO: Komentarji pri vseh Event Handlerjih
// (vsi button click, scroll, changed eventi so sedaj komentarirani)
```

**Kaj je novo?**
- ✅ Naročanja na 5 eventi v konstruktorju
- ✅ 4 novi Event Handleri
- ✅ Komentarji pri vseh event handlerjih

