## OOP Koncepti, ki so Demonstrirani

### 1. Delegati ✅
- `ItemPlayedEventHandler` - tip delegata
- `FilterKriterij` - tip delegata
- `PlaylistChangedEventHandler` - tip delegata
- `NotificationDelegate` - tip delegata
- Lambda expressions - `x => x.Title.Contains(...)`

### 2. Eventi ✅
- `PlayerStats.ItemPlayed` - event
- `Playlist.PlaylistChanged` - event
- `Playlist.PlaylistError` - event
- `Form1.buttonPlay.Click` - Windows Forms event
- `Form1.axWindowsMediaPlayer.PlayStateChange` - COM event

### 3. Event Handlers ✅
- `stats_ItemPlayed()`
- `playlist_PlaylistChanged()`
- `playlist_PlaylistError()`
- `axMediaPlayer_PlayStateChange()`
- `axMediaPlayer_OpenStateChange()`
- `buttonPlay_Click()`, `buttonNext_Click()`, itd...

### 4. Event Pattern ✅
- **Subscribe** (`+=`) - naročanje na event
- **Raise** (`OnEventName()`) - sproženje eventa
- **Invoke** (`?.Invoke()`) - klic vseh naročnikov
- **EventArgs** - `PlaylistErrorEventArgs` - prenos podatkov

### 5. Programska Paradigma ✅
- **Event-Driven Architecture** - aplikacija se odziva na dogodke
- **Publish-Subscribe Pattern** - decoupled komunikacija
- **Loose Coupling** - objekti niso tesno povezani

